# Local dev only. Google OAuth client ID, Neo4j credentials, and the rest
# are configured once via the in-app Setup Wizard (or server/.env) and
# served to the client at runtime from GET /api/setup/status — no client
# rebuild needed to change them. The API location itself is also a
# runtime setting in the Docker image (see client/docker-entrypoint.sh,
# README's Cloud Run section) — this Vite env var is just the local `npm
# run dev` fallback when there's no runtime-config.js to read it from.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
